Rw14 n14 n15 30.14125
Rw15 n15 n16 30.14125
Rw16 n16 n17 30.14125
Rw17 n17 n18 30.14125
Rw18 n18 n19 30.14125
Rw19 n19 n20 30.14125
Rw20 n20 n21 30.14125
Rw21 n21 n22 30.14125
Rw22 n22 n23 30.14125
Rw23 n23 n24 30.14125
Rw24 n24 n25 30.14125
Rw25 n25 n26 30.14125
Rw26 n26 n27 30.14125
Rw27 n27 n28 30.14125
Rw28 n28 n29 30.14125
Rw29 n29 n30 30.14125
Rw30 n30 n31 30.14125
Rw31 n31 n32 30.14125
Rw32 n32 n33 30.14125
Rw33 n33 n34 30.14125
Rw34 n34 n35 30.14125
Rw35 n35 n36 30.14125
Rw36 n36 n37 30.14125
Rw37 n37 n38 30.14125
Rw38 n38 n39 30.14125
Rw39 n39 n40 30.14125
Cw0 n0 0 2.1546875e-15
Cw1 n1 0 4.309375e-15
Cw2 n2 0 4.309375e-15
Cw3 n3 0 4.309375e-15
Cw4 n4 0 4.309375e-15
